msgstr "Rhy&buddio am ffeiliau a addasir gan brosesau allanol"

#: app/kateconfigdialog.cpp:224
msgid ""
"If enabled, a passive popup message will be displayed whenever a local file "
"is modified, created or deleted by another process."
msgstr ""
"Os alluogir, dangosir neges naidlen oddefol pan addasir, creuir neu ddileuir "
"ffeil lleol gan broses arall."

